{
  "text": " Everyone wants that old money look until the bag costs more than the trip, but you don't need a designer label to pull it off. This one gives you that classic, polished feel, whether you're dressing for a weekend away or just heading out for the day. This is the Eleanor Weekender from Volantra. It's perfect for travel or just upgrading your everyday outfit with that old money look. It's Birkin-inspired with that classic shape, top handles, and gold-toned details that make the whole outfit feel more expensive. You don't need a whole new wardrobe to look put together. You need that one piece that makes what you already own work harder. Throw on a white shirt, your favorite jeans, and grab this on your way out. Suddenly, an outfit you barely thought about looks intentional. If you keep saving old money outfits but feel like yours are missing something, try starting with the bag. So if you want that old money look without spending like you inherited it, tap the link and get your Eleanor Weekender.",
